{"site":"douban","sid":"1296753","imdb_id":"tt0034583","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0034583/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1296753/","chinese_title":"卡萨布兰卡","foreign_title":"Casablanca","year":"1942","aka":["北非谍影(港/台)"],"region":["美国"],"genre":["剧情","爱情","战争"],"language":["英语","法语","德语","意大利语"],"playdate":["1942-11-26(纽约首映)","1943-01-23(美国)","1943-07-07(中国大陆)"],"episodes":"","duration":"102分钟","description":"二战期间，卡萨布兰卡是欧洲逃往美国的必经之地，那里鱼龙混杂，局势紧张。里克（亨佛莱•鲍嘉 Humphrey Bogart 饰）是一个神秘的商人，他在卡萨布兰卡开了一家人气很旺的夜总会，并拥有两张宝贵的通行证。一天，反纳粹人士维克多和妻子伊尔莎（英格丽•褒曼 Ingrid Bergman 饰）来到夜总会，原来他们正在逃避纳粹的追捕。碰巧的是，里克发现，伊尔莎竟然是他的旧日情人。那段爱曾经刻骨铭心，却因为一个误会而终止。而当误会消解时，伊尔莎和里克的感情还是不可避免的重燃了。里克手上的两张通行证能帮助维克多度过难关，但这样一来，伊尔莎是决定留下，还是离去，他们的爱情在政治和伦理的推波逐流中走向何方。","poster":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p1244791866.jpg","douban_votes":"246136","douban_rating":"8.7","imdb_rating_average":"8.5","imdb_votes":"659999","imdb_rating":"8.5 / 10 from 659,999 users","director":[{"name":"迈克尔·柯蒂兹 Michael Curtiz","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27222423/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1485782501.72.webp"}],"writer":[{"name":"朱利叶斯·J·爱泼斯坦 Julius J. Epstein","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27231182/","role":"剧本 Screenplay","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1577437950.76.webp"},{"name":"菲利普·G·爱泼斯坦 Philip G. Epstein","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27229162/","role":"剧本 Screenplay","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1577437968.85.webp"},{"name":"霍华德·科克 Howard Koch","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27243292/","role":"剧本 Screenplay","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1368952619.13.webp"},{"name":"默里·伯内特 Murray Burnett","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27221026/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"},{"name":"凯西